  "description": "Point Scrubkit at a folder and get back a clean table of file text + metadata — 100% offline, no telemetry. Extracts text and metadata from PDF, Office (docx/pptx/xlsx), text, and image (EXIF) files, then scrubs common sensitive values (emails, phone numbers, Luhn-checked card numbers, SSNs, IPs) so you can feed cleaner documents into RAG ingestion, search indexing, and data-prep pipelines. Pluggable extractors (IFileExtractor) and redactors (IRedactor); streaming and bounded-parallel processing for large folders.",
